Corner Cafe POS
A full-stack Point-of-Sale system for a small cafe, built with React, Node.js, and PostgreSQL. Includes a browser-based ordering interface, printable receipts, and daily/monthly earnings dashboards.

Features
POS Screen — Browse menu items by category, add to order, adjust quantities, and place orders
Receipt Printing — Print a formatted receipt directly from the browser after checkout
Daily Report — View all orders placed on any given date with total revenue and tax
Monthly Report — View month-by-month earnings, a day-by-day revenue breakdown, and full order history
Persistent Storage — All orders are saved to a PostgreSQL database
Java Console Version — Standalone Java terminal app (cafe-pos/CafePOS.java) for offline use
Tech Stack
Layer	Technology
Frontend	React 19, Vite, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui
Backend	Node.js 24, Express 5, TypeScript
Database	PostgreSQL + Drizzle ORM
Validation	Zod (server) + Orval codegen (client)
API	OpenAPI 3.1 contract-first
Package	pnpm workspaces (monorepo)
